'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

{{TOC limit|2|}}

==Requirements==
Obtain a [[Paradigm Shipping poster]] or check the distress signal via the radio system at the Intelligence Center level 3 in the [[Hideout]].

==Objectives==
* Find out from traders more about the connection between TerraGroup and Paradigm Shipping/Ask [[Mechanic]] where the distress signal came from
* Locate the equipment under the cellular tower on [[Woods]]
* [[Toolset|Repair]] the equipment under the cellular tower on [[Woods]]
* Report back to [[Mechanic]]
* Locate and obtain the [[Paradigm Shipping directive|Paradigm Shipping documentation]]
* Tell [[Mechanic]] about "Boreas"
* Arrange a transport to the [[icebreaker]]
'''If you gave the [[Armored case]] to [[Prapor]] in [[Falling Skies]]'''
* Hand over the [[AMG-10 hydraulic fluid (quest item)|AMG-10 fluid]] to [[Prapor]]

'''If you kept the [[Armored case]] from [[Prapor]] in [[Falling Skies]]'''
* Hand over 3 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[Military power filter]]s to [[Prapor]]
* Hand over the [[AMG-10 hydraulic fluid (quest item)|AMG-10 fluid]] to [[Prapor]]

'''If you have not completed [[Falling Skies]]'''
* Eliminate any 30 targets on [[Reserve]]
* Launch a yellow signal flare at the [[Woods]] transit on [[Reserve]]
* Hand over the [[AMG-10 hydraulic fluid (quest item)|AMG-10 fluid]] to [[Prapor]]
<hr/>
* Find an alternative transport to the [[icebreaker]]
* Talk to the [[BTR Driver]]
'''If you have completed [[The Price of Independence]]'''
* Return to the [[Hideout]]
* Return to the [[BTR Driver]]
* Tell [[Mechanic]] that you found transport to the [[icebreaker]]

'''If you have completed [[Choose Your Friends Wisely]]'''
* Hand over 200 [[7.62x54mm R BT gzh]]
* Locate and obtain [[Skier's docs|Skier's reports]] on [[Customs]]
* Burn [[Skier's docs|Skier's reports]] on [[Customs]]
* Eliminate any 15 targets at the smugglers' territories
* Report back to the [[BTR Driver]]
* Tell [[Mechanic]] that you found transport to the [[icebreaker]]

'''If you have not completed either [[The Price of Independence]] or [[Choose Your Friends Wisely]]'''
* Eliminate any 10 targets at the smugglers' territories
* Report back to the [[BTR Driver]]
* Tell [[Mechanic]] that you found transport to the [[icebreaker]]
<hr/>
* Board the smuggler hovercraft on [[Shoreline]] or [[Lighthouse]]
** (''Optional'') Bring a [[Sudak-Tudak marine repair kit|marine repair kit]]
** (''Optional'') Bring a green RSP signal flare
** (''Optional'') Bring 2,500 [[Euros]] to pay for the evacuation from the [[icebreaker]]
* Arrive at the [[Icebreaker]]
* Check if any crew members survived on the ship
* Access the [[Boreas engine room keycard|engine room]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the [[Boreas engine room keycard|engine room keycard]]
** (''Optional'') Reach the [[Boreas engine room keycard|engine room]]
* Find a [[SZ-1 explosive charge|way]] into the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]] superstructure
* Ask [[Mechanic]] about explosives
* Ask [[Prapor]] about explosives
* Arrive at the [[Icebreaker]]
* Reach the damaged door on the roof of the engine room
* Break the chain on the door on the roof of the engine room using the [[SZ-1 explosive charge (Icebreaker)|SZ-1 charge]]
* Enter the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]] superstructure from the roof of the engine room
** (''Optional'') Inspect the crew living quarters in the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]] superstructure
* Find a way to the upper decks of the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]] superstructure
* Ask the surviving scientist how to open the code-locked door on level 6
* Ask [[Mechanic]] for help with finding the second part of the code for the locked door on level 6
* Plant the [[Local network hacking device|hacking device]] in the server room in [[The Lab]]
* Return to [[Mechanic]]
* Arrive at the [[Icebreaker]]
* Reach the engine room
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the [[Boreas engine room keycard|engine room keycard]]
* Reach the damaged door on the roof of the engine room
<hr/>
'''After completing''' [[Stick to It]]
* Return to the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
'''After completing''' [[A Bitter Victory]]
* Return to the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
<hr/>
* Break the chain on the door on the roof of the engine room using the [[SZ-1 explosive charge (Icebreaker)|SZ-1 charge]]
* Reach the code-locked door
* Use the correct access code
* Locate [[Compartment C-1 keycard|compartment C-1]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the [[Compartment C-1 keycard|keycard]] with access to compartment C-1
** (''Optional'') Locate the entrance to the bridge
** (''Optional'') Locate an alternative path to the bridge
* Reach the upper decks
* Thaw the hatch on the roof of the bridge
** (''Optional'') Find [[BBQ-S43 gas torch|something]] to thaw the hatch on the roof of the bridge
* Rescue the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]] captain
* Access [[Compartment C-1 keycard|Compartment C-1]]
* [[Hard drive from compartment C-1 (3)|Search the shelves]] in [[Compartment C-1 keycard|compartment C-1]]
* [[Hard drive from compartment C-1 (1)|Search the area near the workstation]] in [[Compartment C-1 keycard|compartment C-1]]
* [[Hard drive from compartment C-1 (2)|Search the servers]] in [[Compartment C-1 keycard|compartment C-1]]
* Ask [[Mechanic]] for help decoding the hard drives from the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Hand over 3 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[Ultralink satellite communication module|Ultralink satellite modules]] to [[Mechanic]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain [[Ultralink satellite communication module|Ultralink satellite modules]] on the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Hand over 4 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] server [[Memento Server RAM Module|RAM modules]] to [[Mechanic]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the server [[Memento Server RAM Module|RAM modules]] on the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Hand over 2 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[IBX Gigachad cryptographic processor|cryptographic processors]] to [[Mechanic]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the [[IBX Gigachad cryptographic processor|cryptographic processors]] on the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Analyse the [[Icebreaker archive data|data]] from the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Inform the scientist about the captain's death
* Ask the BTR driver if he can help evacuate the scientist from the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Assist the smugglers with their conflict against the Rogues
* Return to the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
* Eliminate 20 targets on the [[Icebreaker|icebreaker]]
* Hand over 5 respirators to the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain respirators for the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
* Hand over 2 class 5 or higher ballistic plates to the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain class 5+ ballistic plates for the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
* Hand over the [[BNTI Kirasa-N body armor|Kirasa-N body armor]] to the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain the [[BNTI Kirasa-N body armor|Kirasa-N body armor]] for the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]]
* Inform the scientist that everything is ready for his evacuation
* Ask the [[BTR Driver|BTR driver]] how the scientist's rescue went

